Z||000000||RNGCRSH||11-26-2000||01:08 PM||||Has Anyone installed the RCC 12" brakes with corvette calipers if so does the spare tire fit or do you have to get a different one? I am doing a major suspension and brake overhaul over the winter. Big brakes are worthless if I have a flat and no spare.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by RNGCRSH (edited 11-26-2000).]||||reg||1
